{"id":4112,"title":{"romaji":"Level 1 dakedo Unique Skill de Saikyou desu","english":"My Unique Skill Makes Me OP even at Level 1","native":"レベル1だけどユニークスキルで最強です"},"slug":"level_1_dakedo_unique_skill_de_saikyou_desu","synopsis":"Satou Ryouta, a salaryman working for an exploitative company, suddenly finds himself inside an unfamiliar dungeon in a strange world where monsters drop all sorts of items as loot. With the help of a girl he happens to run into named Emily, he's able to check his own stats... and finds that all of them, both physical and magical, are at rank F (the weakest)! What's more, his level is stuck at 1 (the lowest)! Ryouta is on the verge of utter despair... but then he learns that he also has \"Drop Skill: All S,\" the most powerful unique skill there is! Can Ryouta manage to survive in this bizarre world?! The strongest and weakest adventure of all is about to begin! \n\r\n\n\r\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2023,"createdAt":"2023-07-11 20:59:35","updatedAt":"2024-03-22 21:11:56","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":51764},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":148465},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17353},{"site":"ANN","externalId":25657},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46099},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":19501},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11279,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/frhNornxx6FpMzvnVATa5BR6DhgvDha3zybW3Nz2.jpg"},{"id":11280,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/U8CFPUGNiKle0RE8GcueZZaRiMRXUcJnZiG0l3Ls.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":3,"name":"Maho Film","slug":"maho_film"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":12389,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12354,"title":{"romaji":"Chase Me","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":14490,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":17045,"basename":